## Local development environment
## Copy this file to `.env.local` and set local flags below

## Development: force a mock authenticated user so you can inspect the UI without signing in
## Set to 'true' in `.env.local` to bypass auth and use a local mock user.
VITE_FORCE_MOCK_USER=false
## When true, the app runs exclusively against a local in-browser datastore (localStorage)
## and local file storage (object URLs). This is useful to prototype UI without external services.
VITE_LOCAL_ONLY=false

# Tip: copy this file to `.env.local` and edit the flags you need (VITE_LOCAL_ONLY or VITE_FORCE_MOCK_USER).
